"""Mutations of part 8b's sight module (src/game/sight.*) for ../mutfast.py with the world build:

    python mutfast.py mutations/mutate_8b.py --models DIR --build build_world.bat --check check_world.py

DIR holds a .txt per mission ("mission NAME"; the sight test runs the same in each). Each mutation
should make check_world.py fail (or the harness crash / hang). Generated from the sources (a
comparison, a number, an operator or a statement per line), then pruned. Left out as equivalent
(18): the parts tables' bit values (only the names are read); Relation's first false (both flags
are set before they are read); the human's first view value (the test writes it); the part test's
skip flag (a part not due keeps the answer "anything seen", so seen / lost never change by it) and
its next-test reset (set again below), the meleeTracker's for a kind no target has, and its kind
check's result; Clear's loops from 1 (leaks); the start delay reaching exactly 0 (both compares
leave 0); the reverse pair's WantsTest (its answer is not used); the virtual destructors (leaks);
the targets' part count default (set by both subclasses). 12 more did not compile (the target
states colliding as case labels, the pure virtuals' "= 0", the destructor) and were dropped.

Results (2026-10-30): the first run caught 354 of 432 (12 did not compile, 66 survived); of the
66, 17 equivalent and 49 with new cases (SetRelation's results and its reset of a reused slot, a
part nested under another volume and a second frame of its name, the target's vehicle and a
tracker target alive in the part test, an actor of another type, a negative and an unset
meleeTracker view, a tracker without frames, the states by number, masks 1 and 2, a second dead
target, a removed friend's count, frames without their actors, observer 0, links already cut, a
delay ending at 1, a cursor at the targets' end, the budget left at 1, a target without an
observer, the module's start values). A test of an id past the records wrote out of bounds and
made 4 mutants crash at random; it was removed, 3 of the 4 got cases and Clear's observer loop was
dropped as a leak. The full rerun: all 402 caught.
"""
